{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"くっくくっく(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はゆっくり寝たあとに\nお菓子作りをしました～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の料理楽しいヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何作ったと思いますか～？♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つくってる行程はこんな感じヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/01/12/9674859/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解は～..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃんっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/01/12/9674859/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/01/12/9674859/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちごタルトでした～∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べたい？ヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーげないっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族もおいしいっ♪♪っていって\n食べてくれて嬉しかったなぁ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"料理でリフレッシュできた\n1日でしたとさヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは☆\nまなったんとおしゃべり\ntime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.まなったんは大学でどんなこと学んでるん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.私の通ってるとこは学部問わず\nいろんなこと学べるから\n語学や芸術とかいろいろです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.待ち合わせの時は待つのと待たされるのだったらどっちがいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.私、急かされるのが\nあんまり好きじゃないから\n待つ方が好きかなぁ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.七草粥は食べた？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.味が苦手だから、今年は\n食べなかったよ～ヾ(｡><)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.今度、好きな同じ年の女の子と一緒に水族館に行くことになったんだけど、まなったんは水族館行ったら何を見たいー？あと、服装は男子はどういうのを着ていったらいいかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.イルカを見たいなぁ♪\nあの可愛い顔に癒されそうっ∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服装はニットにデニム履いて\nアウターはダッフルコートとか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり気張りすぎない\nカジュアルなのがいいかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デートうまく行きますようにっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.弟と3歳はなれてるって言ってたけど普段仲良しなの？どんな関係？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.すごく小さい頃はしょっちゅう\n蹴り合いの喧嘩してたんだけど\n今は仲いいですよ～(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"弟は真夏よりもしっかりものだから\nいろいろやってもらえて助かる｀‐ω‐´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.真夏が好きな匂いは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.洗い立ての洗濯物とか\nシャンプーの匂いが好きっ(((っ･ω･)っ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.真夏の理想の告白のされ方は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.好きって言われたら真夏も\n好きになっちゃうなぁ～///♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまでっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー、おしゃべりtime\n楽しい(((っ･ω･)っ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/01/12/9674859/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちごちゃんがかわいいから\nちゅーしてやりました(｀・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃまた明日ね～ヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ☆"}],"source":"archive"}